        "finding": "The lane DESIGN.md clearly assigns complete first-connected-ID resolution and owning budgets to the native host callback, but the production option is only a function type and the repository Markdown search found no clipReference contract. A future native caller could reasonably mistake the engine's type/ID checks for connected/document-first validation or return undefined after a partial search.",
